<title>INDIA: SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS. [CORRECTED 23:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>SQUASH-MAHINDRA INTERNATIONAL QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS. [CORRECTED 23:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY, India 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of quarter-finals in the Mahindra International squash tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Paul Gregory (Greece)  15-8 15-8 15-7</p>
<p>Mark Cairns (England) beat Derek Ryan (Ireland) 13-15 15-6 15-12 15-4</p>
<p>(Corrects second game score to 15-6 from 15-7)</p>
<p> Simon Parke (England) beat Zubair Jahan (Pakistan)   15-11</p>
<p>15-17 7-15 15-7 15-4</p>
<p>Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat Ahmed Barada (Egypt) 13-15 17-15 15-8 15-9. (Corrects score in final two games to 15-8 and 15-9, from 15-7 and 15-10 respectively)</p>
</text>
